translate thai day7_start_badend_ea11c52d:

    # "You shake your head and go back to [pet_name]. [pet_She] is still looking a little bit sickly."
    "คุณ​ส่าย​หัว​แล้ว​กลับ​ไปหา[pet_name] [pet_She]ยัง​ดู​อ่อนเพลีย​อยู่​หน่อย​ๆ"

# game/chapters/bad_end.rpy:241
translate thai day7_start_badend_6eed09cb:

    # "You kneel down in front of [pet_her2] and concentrate as hard as you can - concentrate on your wish."
